Continues the corrective sequence after the successful one-real-batch run.

Scope:
- add a reviewed five-work canary scope;
- pin target commit `d9abc05fa648f8b2049fb443477bc8f97691cf7f`;
- restore the exact successful run 32477973065 artifact;
- authenticate its manifest and discovered-inventory roots before use;
- force live service revalidation so prior checkpoint membership cannot create a false pass;
- reconcile selected identities, CAS fixity, and cumulative manifest/checkpoint state;
- retain all success/failure evidence as a 90-day artifact.

Expected outcome:
One explicitly confirmed dispatch recontacts the official service for five exact works and proves either source-backed change or conditional no-change while preserving the cumulative 500-record state.

